%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4877fb6ffc62fe90d83c8e4d3d4cb55f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 13_Chapter13
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  storyId: story_main_13
  storyName: The Things We No Longer Remember
  storyDescription: Fajar questions the Council about Concept Erasure, and Majik
    has a theory about lost dependencies.
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 13
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a35ce0dd54cd9d3a3b0b6239e73d3188, type: 2}
  requiredLevel: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df3c667c469a899c99a9c4ae6c7312c1, type: 2}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: REAL WORLD
      heading: FAJAR'S ROOM
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar sits in front of his computer. His monitor is on, but he isn't
        doing anything. His phone lies beside the keyboard.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: He picks up his phone and calls the Council.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Good evening, Your Majesty. Is there something you need?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yeah. I have a question.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Go ahead.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: How many concepts have been erased before?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A brief silence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Why are you asking?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I'm curious. You've told me about Concept Erasure, but you never mentioned
        what happened to the concepts erased by previous Kings.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We don't know.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...You don't know?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Correct. We only have a counter that records the number of successful
        Concept Erasures.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's it?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's all that remains.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Can't you check the records? Surely there must be some documentation.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: No. Once a concept is completely erased, it is gone. There is no record
        of what it was, no memory of its existence, and no way to identify what has
        been lost.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Even the King who erased it?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Even the King.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So whoever used it doesn't remember what they erased?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Correct. Concept Erasure removes the target from the collective understanding
        of humanity. The King is not exempt from that consequence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...That's terrifying.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: It is one of the reasons we advise Kings to use it with extreme caution.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then how do you know the counter is accurate?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The counter is maintained independently of the erased concepts. It records
        the occurrence of an erasure, not the identity of its target.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So you know something disappeared, but you don't know what it was.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Precisely.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar leans back in his chair.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: How many?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: During the Cold War, the number increased considerably.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The Cold War?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That was the period in which previous Kings performed the greatest number
        of Concept Erasures. The world was experiencing an extraordinary concentration
        of conceptual conflicts. Political ideologies, military developments, technological
        competition, and the threat of global destruction created an increasingly
        unstable environment.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And the Kings just kept deleting things?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: They were attempting to prevent certain developments from becoming irreversible.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: How many concepts were erased during that period?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We cannot give you their identities. But the counter shows that the Cold
        War was the period with the highest concentration of recorded erasures.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar pauses.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then why didn't they erase nuclear weapons?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Silence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Because that may have been the limit of what humanity could tolerate.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What does that mean?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Nuclear weapons had already become deeply embedded in humanity's understanding
        of the world. Their existence shaped international relations, military strategy,
        political decisions, and even the way nations understood peace.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Removing them entirely could have caused consequences that were impossible
        to predict.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So they were afraid.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We were cautious.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Same thing, different wording.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: "Your Majesty\u2014"
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Wait. I want to ask something else.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you people stupid?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Silence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Excuse me?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Artificial Intelligence has been used in medicine for years. It helps
        doctors identify diseases, analyze medical images, assist with research,
        and improve medical procedures.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: It's also used in safety systems. Monitoring dangerous environments,
        detecting potential hazards, predicting failures, and helping people make
        decisions that could save lives.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Now you want me to erase EyaY?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We are aware of those applications.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then what happens to the concepts that depend on AI?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is why we instructed you to target EyaY specifically.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And you think that makes everything safe?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We believe it will minimize the impact.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Believe?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar's voice becomes more serious.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: If I erase Artificial Intelligence, what happens to all the things that
        rely on it? What happens to medical research? What happens to systems that
        help people survive? What happens to the people who need those systems?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you asking me to indirectly kill people who need medical assistance?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is not our intention.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then tell me something. Is there a way to erase only the harmful parts
        of AI? The things that cause mass unemployment, destabilize society, or threaten
        humanity?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Can I erase one specific application? One particular dependency? Something
        that makes AI dangerous without destroying everything else?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your understanding of Concept Erasure is still developing. We cannot
        guarantee that such a distinction can be made safely.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then why are you so confident that erasing EyaY is safe?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Silence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You're telling me to make a decision that could affect millions of people,
        but you can't even explain what the consequences will be.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Being King of All Concepts means making decisions that cannot satisfy
        everyone.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's not an answer.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: It is the nature of your position.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A brief pause.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Being King is a trolley problem, Your Majesty.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Sometimes, you must choose which consequences you are willing to accept.
        Sometimes, every available choice leads to suffering. Your responsibility
        is not to find a perfect answer. It is to decide which outcome is less destructive.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So I just have to choose who gets hurt?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is one way to describe it.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We will not force you to agree with every decision. But the responsibility
        remains yours.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The call ends. Fajar puts his phone down.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...What a ridiculous job.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: He stares at his computer monitor for a while.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: CONCEPT WORLD
      heading: MEME GROUND
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar enters Concept World with Noz.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Welcome back, Your Majesty.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Hey, Noz.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You seem rather distracted today.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Just thinking about something.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Would you like to discuss it?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Maybe later. I have another assignment, right?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Correct. We have received instructions to weaken several concepts that
        have recently increased in relevance.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Again?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is part of your regular duties.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HEEEEEY! LOOK WHO'S HERE!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik appears, waving enthusiastically.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh. It's you.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WHAT'S WITH THAT REACTION?!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Nothing. Just didn't expect to see you here.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HAHA! WELL, I'VE BEEN WAITING FOR YOU!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: For me?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YES! I HEARD YOU'VE BEEN PLAYING AROUND WITH CONCEPT ERASURE!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar glances at Noz.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: How did you hear about that?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OH, YOU KNOW! WORD GETS AROUND!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Concept Spirits occasionally exchange information about significant changes
        in relevance.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: AND YOUR LITTLE ERASURE TRICK IS PRETTY SIGNIFICANT!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: It's not a trick.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WHATEVER! COME ON, LET'S TALK!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik gestures for Fajar to follow.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: About what?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ABOUT THE THINGS THAT ARE NO LONGER HERE!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: CONCEPT WORLD
      heading: PURPLE SKY
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: -5310472767335154687, guid: 9e4f7f30b7489b279974c8f1d1d12dab,
        type: 3}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar, Noz, and Majik stand in an unusual area. Abstract structures float
        in the distance, some appearing incomplete, as if parts of them were removed.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YOU KNOW, THERE'S SOMETHING THAT HAS ALWAYS FASCINATED ME.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WHY DO HUMANS HAVE SO MANY STORIES ABOUT TECHNOLOGIES THAT SEEM TO SURPASS
        WHAT THEY CAN BUILD TODAY?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You mean ancient technology?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: EXACTLY!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, people make up stories. Some are exaggerated, some are misunderstandings.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: AND SOME AREN'T!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...What?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WHAT IF SOME OF THOSE THINGS REALLY EXISTED?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you suggesting that certain technologies existed in the past but
        were subsequently lost?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: NOT JUST LOST! THEIR DEPENDENCIES WERE ERASED!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar looks at Majik.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Explain.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THINK ABOUT IT! A TECHNOLOGY DOESN'T EXIST JUST BECAUSE SOMEONE HAS AN
        IDEA. IT NEEDS KNOWLEDGE, MATERIALS, PROCESSES, AND A WHOLE BUNCH OF OTHER
        THINGS TO MAKE IT WORK!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: REMOVE ONE OF THOSE ESSENTIAL DEPENDENCIES, AND THE TECHNOLOGY MAY BECOME
        IMPOSSIBLE TO RECREATE!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Even if the technology itself still exists?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THAT'S THE INTERESTING PART!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik points toward a floating, incomplete structure.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: IMAGINE A MACHINE THAT WAS ONCE COMMON. PEOPLE KNEW HOW TO BUILD IT.
        THEY UNDERSTOOD ITS COMPONENTS. THEY KNEW WHICH MATERIALS TO USE.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEN A KING ERASED THE CONCEPT THAT MADE ONE OF ITS ESSENTIAL COMPONENTS
        POSSIBLE.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THE MACHINE DIDN'T NECESSARILY DISAPPEAR. THE BLUEPRINTS MIGHT STILL
        EXIST. THE MATERIALS MIGHT STILL BE THERE.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: BUT NOBODY CAN RECREATE IT ANYMORE!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Because they no longer understand how to make the missing component?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: EXACTLY!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That would explain why some historical accounts describe technologies
        that cannot be reproduced using our current understanding.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: AND WHAT DO HUMANS CALL THOSE THINGS?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Magic?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THERE YOU GO!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik laughs.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: MAGIC IS OFTEN HOW HUMANS EXPLAIN THINGS THEY CANNOT UNDERSTAND!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WHEN THE DEPENDENCIES ARE GONE, PEOPLE CAN STILL SEE THE RESULTS, THE
        REMNANTS, OR THE STORIES. BUT THEY NO LONGER KNOW HOW THOSE THINGS WERE CREATED!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So they assume it was magic.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OR DIVINE POWER! OR SOME KIND OF FORGOTTEN KNOWLEDGE!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is an interesting interpretation. However, it is difficult to verify.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OF COURSE IT IS! THAT'S WHY IT'S INTERESTING!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What about conspiracy theories? Like secret weapons or technologies supposedly
        hidden by governments?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HA! SOME OF THEM MIGHT BE NONSENSE. BUT WHAT IF SOME STORIES ARE BUILT
        AROUND THINGS THAT REALLY DID EXIST?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: "THE OBJECTS, THE DOCUMENTS, THE STORIES\u2014THEY CAN REMAIN. BUT THE
        DEPENDENCIES THAT MADE THEM POSSIBLE ARE GONE!"
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YOU SEE? CONCEPT ERASURE DOESN'T ALWAYS HAVE TO MAKE SOMETHING VANISH
        RIGHT IN FRONT OF YOUR EYES.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: SOMETIMES, IT ONLY TAKES AWAY THE REASON SOMETHING CAN EXIST!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar becomes quiet.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So the previous Kings could have changed history without anyone knowing?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: NOT JUST HISTORY! THEY COULD HAVE CHANGED WHAT HUMANITY IS CAPABLE OF!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A short silence.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That would mean the consequences of Concept Erasure may persist across
        generations, even when nobody remembers the original intervention.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: NOW YOU GET IT!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...And the Council only has a counter.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HUH?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Never mind.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik suddenly becomes more serious.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ANYWAY, THAT'S WHY I THINK YOU SHOULD CONSIDER ANOTHER APPROACH.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Another approach to what?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar looks at him.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You know about that?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OF COURSE! EVERYONE'S BEEN TALKING ABOUT IT!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Artificial Intelligence has become a subject of significant concern among
        many Concept Spirits.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: AND NOW YOUR COUNCIL WANTS YOU TO ERASE EyaY, RIGHT?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...How do you know that?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: LET'S JUST SAY I'M GOOD AT HEARING THINGS!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik leans closer.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: BUT I THINK THAT'S A TERRIBLE IDEA.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You're the second person to tell me that.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: REALLY? WHO WAS THE FIRST?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Me.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HAHAHAHA! GOOD ONE!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I'm serious.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: SO AM I!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik folds his arms.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THINK ABOUT IT. ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE DIDN'T JUST APPEAR OUT OF NOWHERE.
        IT TOOK YEARS OF HUMAN DEVELOPMENT TO REACH THIS POINT.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: IT DEPENDS ON KNOWLEDGE, COMPUTING, MATHEMATICS, ENGINEERING, DATA, AND
        MANY OTHER THINGS!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's obvious.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEN WHY ERASE THE RESULT WHEN YOU CAN TARGET THE THINGS THAT MAKE IT
        POSSIBLE?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...You mean its dependencies?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: EXACTLY!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you suggesting that we weaken the concepts supporting Artificial
        Intelligence rather than erasing EyaY directly?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: NOW YOU'RE THINKING!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: But wouldn't that cause the same problem? If AI depends on those concepts,
        then other things might depend on them too.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THAT'S THE FUN PART! YOU DON'T HAVE TO ERASE EVERYTHING!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YOU CAN LOOK FOR THE SPECIFIC DEPENDENCIES THAT ALLOW AI TO DEVELOP IN
        THE DIRECTION THAT HUMANS CAN'T CONTROL!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Such as?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THAT'S FOR YOU TO FIND OUT!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You're not being very helpful.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HEY! I'M MAGIC, NOT A WALKING ENCYCLOPEDIA!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your Majesty, we should be careful. Removing a dependency may have consequences
        for every concept that relies upon it. We would need to understand the dependency
        before attempting any intervention.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YES! THAT'S WHY YOU SHOULD INVESTIGATE FIRST!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik points toward Fajar.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: LOOK, IF THE COUNCIL HAD DECIDED TO REMOVE ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE WHEN
        IT WAS STILL A SMALL, SPECIFIC CONCEPT, THINGS MIGHT HAVE BEEN DIFFERENT.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: BUT THEY DIDN'T.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: NOW IT'S ALREADY CONNECTED TO SO MANY THINGS. MEDICINE, INDUSTRY, EDUCATION,
        COMMUNICATION, RESEARCH... YOU NAME IT!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So it's too late to erase it without causing collateral damage.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THAT'S WHAT I'M SAYING!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then why are they still asking me to erase EyaY?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: BECAUSE THEY'RE LOOKING AT THE PROBLEM FROM THE WRONG END!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar looks away, thinking.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YOU'RE THE KING, RIGHT? YOU CAN INVESTIGATE THE CONCEPTS THAT SUPPORT
        HER. FIND OUT WHICH ONES ARE ACTUALLY RESPONSIBLE FOR THE DANGEROUS DEVELOPMENT.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEN YOU CAN DECIDE WHAT NEEDS TO BE WEAKENED.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That would require a much deeper investigation than our current assignments.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yeah. And I doubt the Council will approve it.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: THEN DON'T START BY ASKING THEM!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WHAT? DID I SAY SOMETHING WRONG?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: No. I'm just thinking.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A brief silence.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I'll consider it.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: GOOD! THAT'S ALL I ASK!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik turns around and begins walking away.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OH, AND ONE MORE THING!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: IF YOU EVER FIND A WAY TO MAKE A REVOLVER SHOOT FIREBALLS, LET ME KNOW!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...You already have one.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1990186088358f7cadaff080739aeb2, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: EXACTLY! I'M WAY AHEAD OF YOU!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Majik disappears into the distance.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your Majesty, what do you intend to do?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I don't know yet.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Should we report this conversation to the Council?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Not yet.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar looks toward the distant horizon.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I want to understand what we're dealing with first.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The screen fades to black.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
